    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that people say that, but it feels so fake. i'm just sitting here and the world keeps spinning like i'm not even part of it. if i actually did something to leave, would anyone even notice the gap? or would the world just keep moving like nothing happened? it feels like i'm already gone anyway.",
